# bat configuration
# https://github.com/sharkdp/bat#configuration-file

# atomic.nvim themes (bat/themes, registered via `bat cache --build`).
# bat queries the terminal background's luma at startup and picks the
# matching variant, so this follows the Ghostty dark:atomic /
# light:atomic_light pair without a hardcoded choice.
--theme-dark="atomic"
--theme-light="atomic-light"
